  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5 qualifies existing foreground/background color retention, opaque-panel styled blanks, damage-aware rendition refresh, capability fallback, and lifecycle repaint across .NET 8/9/10; adds a public-only color sample and package consumer. No public API changes. Existing bounded clipboard and cursor-style APIs remain. The sole direct runtime dependency is stable Icod.Terminal 1.29.0.",
